Cell id="t161" value="Алиасы старых путей (vfs_alias.c): /bin/program → /usr/bin  ·  /bin/program/system → /bin  ·  /game → /usr/games  ·  /bin/sound → /usr/share/sounds  ·  /walpaper → /usr/share/wallpapers  ·  /demo, /src/demo → /usr/share/demo  ·  /include → /usr/include  ·  /bin/modules → /lib/modules  ·  /bin/firmware → /lib/firmware.   Диск: GPT, ESP (FAT32, ядро и initramfs) + раздел ext2 с корнем /." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;rounded=1;arcSize=6;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1108" width="1648" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>